# Enforce LF line endings for shell scripts and Docker build files so
# container entrypoints don't fail with "no such file or directory" caused
# by a stray CR before the shebang newline (kernel tries /bin/bash\r, which
# doesn't exist). Without this, `git checkout` on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites these files to CRLF on every pull.
*.sh         text eol=lf
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
